  "description": "Wkg.AspNetCore introduces new abstractions over existing ASP .NET Core components, request-scoped database transactions, new authentication options, data validation, and more. It aims to simplify developing ASP .NET Core applications through a set of reusable components that can be easily integrated into new or existing projects, allowing for consistent and maintainable codebases and easier testing with the Wkg.AspNetCore.TestAdapters companion library.",
